## 8. Failure Handling

| Failure | Detected by | Result |
|---|---|---|
| Clone/fetch fails (bad URL, auth) | Workspace manager | `error`, description names the git error (token redacted) |
| Given branch missing | Workspace manager | `error` |
| Worker raises / SDK crashes | Task runner | `error` with exception summary |
| Worker exceeds `TASK_TIMEOUT` | Task runner | Cancel, `error`, partial changes committed to the branch if any |
| Worker reports `success: false` | Report builder | `error`, worker's summary as description |
| Push rejected, rebase conflict | Workspace manager | `error`, work pushed to the `-conflict` branch |
| Node process dies mid-task | On restart, `state.json` says `busy` | `error` ("node restarted") |
| Router unreachable at registration | Registrar | Retry with backoff; the API still serves |
| Router stops polling | Registrar watchdog | Re-register |
| No ack after done/error | `ACK_TIMEOUT` | Self-release to `idle`, report archived |

