## 10. Tech Stack

| Concern | Choice | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Language | Python 3.12 | SDK requires 3.10+ |
| HTTP server | FastAPI + Uvicorn | Async, auto OpenAPI docs at `/docs` (handy for the router team) |
| Schemas | Pydantic v2 | Kebab-case aliases to match the spec's JSON |
| HTTP client | httpx (async) | Registration calls |
| Agent | `claude-agent-sdk` | Bundles the Claude Code CLI |
| Git | `git` CLI via `asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` | Simpler and more predictable than GitPython |
| Persistence | JSON files on disk | One slot plus an archive; no DB needed |
| Logging | `structlog` (JSON lines) + redaction processor | |
| Packaging | `uv` + `pyproject.toml` | |
| Container | Docker (python:3.12-slim + git) | One node per container |
| Testing | `pytest`, `pytest-asyncio`, a `FakeWorker` implementing the adapter | Lets the whole protocol be tested without API calls |

